            <title>0.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:13:39 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://stickywindows.com/</link>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Rename tabs and groups</h2>
<p>Right-click any tab and choose Rename to give it your own name; it shows on the tab, in the fan, and in the menu, and survives relaunches. Groups can be named too, and can mix windows from different apps.</p>
]]></description>
